  "overview": "Buildit Gravity — UI pattern library and design tokens by Wipro Digital Buildit.",
  "dos": "- **Surface & Theme Polarity**: Crisp light (#ffffff) canvas paired with `#ffffff` component surfaces and `#0b0b0c` primary ink.\n- **Brand & Interactive Accent**: Primary actions and focus states anchor on `#0060ff` with `#ffffff` label contrast.\n- **Typographic Voice**: Headings and UI controls set in `Helvetica Neue` across 4 type steps.\n- **Component Geometry**: Buttons (`8px`), cards (`12px`), inputs, badges, and navigation bars share consistent spacing and border contrast."
